; Module export table. The MTA server loader (CLuaModule) resolves these six
; entry points by name; everything else stays internal to the DLL so module
; symbols cannot collide with other modules in the server process.
; The LIBRARY name is filled in by CMake from SDK_MODULE_NAME.
LIBRARY @SDK_MODULE_NAME@
EXPORTS
    InitModule
    RegisterFunctions
    DoPulse
    ShutdownModule
    ResourceStopping
    ResourceStopped